 // Rear apron: original crest zc=121.03+k*(x-90.2) stays at y=4.
 // Folded top z=f(x)-tan(5deg)*(y-4), with a FLAT inward-channel floor.
 // Clip BOTH lips to world Y=44; the whole apron remains below the crest.
 // Flat print: rail y=0 on bed, build +Y; new underside overhang <=5deg.
 var apronTargetY=44;
 var apronSlope=tan(5*degree);
